  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1102.22 Financial assistance agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1102.22 “Financial assistance agreement” means the contract between the state and a recipient that establishes the rights and obligations of the state and the recipient relative to financial assistance from the DWSRF. The term includes original loan agreements, supplemental loan agreements, initial loan documents, and allonges.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Dw 1100) #13160, eff 1-20-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1100.html"
